  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your eyes lack the limits of other judow.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Nocturne gaze species trait, character level 9th.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Your nocturne gaze does not have a limit on how many times it can be used per day.</p>\n<p><strong>Normal:</strong> A judow can only use their nocturne gaze a number of times per day equal to their Wisdom modifier.</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/judow#toc40\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
